"<user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-from-dom0:copying files from dom0>`. Or, you "
"can write the data you wish to copy into ``/var/run/qubes/qubes-clipboard."
"bin``, then ``echo -n dom0 > /var/run/qubes/qubes-clipboard.bin.source``. "
"Then use Ctrl+Shift+V to paste the data to the target qube."
msgstr ""

